//! TL type library for the Telegram API.
//!
//! Schema-shaped types are GENERATED by `tools/gentl.py`
//! (`--compat --domain <name>`) into `<domain>_gen.rs` files;
//! they are the single source of truth for wire format. Hand-
//! written modules keep curated aggregates and helper impls
//! (`MessageFull`, `FileLocation`, accessor methods, the update
//! dispatcher's `Update` surface).

